# ── Cloudflare Pages rewrites ─────────────────────────────
# Status 200 = REWRITE (URL in the browser stays clean, e.g. /admin/classes)
# Status 301/302 would be a real redirect and show /portals/... in the URL.
# Rules are matched in order, first match wins — put explicit rules BEFORE wildcards.

# ── Auth / landing ─────────────────────────────────────────
